## Overview
Machine learning pipeline for breast cancer classification using the Scikit‑learn Breast Cancer dataset. Features robust data scaling and a Random Forest classifier with detailed evaluation metrics.

## Features
• 🤷‍♀️ Data scaling with StandardScaler
• 📝 Random Forest classification
• 📈 Accuracy, ROC‑AUC, and classification report
• 🌟 ROC curve visualisation (roc_curve.png)

## How to Run
```bash
cd 27-Machine-Learning-DiseasePrediction
pip install -r requirements.txt
python CodeAlpha_DiseasePrediction.py
```
